----------------------

This add-on runs on Orange Data Mining, the Orange3-Timeseries add-on, NumPy
and SciPy, which are dependencies installed separately and are not included
in this package:

- Orange Data Mining (Orange3), Copyright (C) Bioinformatics Laboratory,
  Faculty of Computer and Information Science, University of Ljubljana.
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.
  <https://orangedatamining.com/>
- Orange3-Timeseries, Copyright (C) Bioinformatics Laboratory, Faculty of
  Computer and Information Science, University of Ljubljana.
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.
  <https://github.com/biolab/orange3-timeseries>
- NumPy, Copyright (C) NumPy Developers.
  Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. <https://numpy.org/>
- SciPy, Copyright (C) SciPy Developers.
  Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. <https://scipy.org/>

The widgets of this add-on import and subclass Orange and Orange3-Timeseries
classes (such as OWWidget, OWBaseModel and _BaseModel). The method
OWRegressionModel.update_learner() in widgets/owregressionmodel.py is a short
modified version of OWBaseModel.update_learner() from Orange3-Timeseries
(Copyright (C) Bioinformatics Laboratory, University of Ljubljana,
GPL-3.0-or-later), changed to handle the case in which no learner is
connected. No other source code from Orange, Orange3-Timeseries or other
projects has been copied into this package.

The diagrams in the assets/ folder of the repository, which illustrate the
README and are not included in the distributed package, embed widget icons
from Orange Data Mining (File, Data Table, kNN, Tree, Linear Regression and
Random Forest) and from Orange3-Timeseries (Form Timeseries, ARIMA Model and
Model Evaluation). Those icons belong to the Bioinformatics Laboratory,
University of Ljubljana, and are distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 or later, as part of Orange and Orange3-Timeseries.
